  <dashboards>
    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Dashboard 1'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1000' minheight='800' minwidth='1000' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='98000' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontsize='18'>Analysis</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='16'>Summary View</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>Overview</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>- Display the total no. of hired employees, active employees and terminated employees</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>- Visualize the total no. of hired and terminated employees over the years </run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>- Present a breakdown of total employees by departments and job titles </run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>- Compare total employees between Headquarters (NYC is the headquarters) vs. other branches </run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>- Show the distribution of employees by city and state  </run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>Demographics</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>- The Demographics section should offer insights into the composition of the workforce, including: </run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>- Present the gender ratio of the company </run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>- Visualize the distribution of employees across age groups and education levels </run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>- Show the total number of employees within each age group </run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>- Show the total number of employees within each education level </run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>- Present the correlation between employees&apos; educational backgrounds and their performance ratings </run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>Income</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>Æ </run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>- Compare salaries across different education levels for both genders to identify any discrepancies or patterns - since the genders are measures and I am comparing the measures </run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>-  Present how the age correlates with the salary for employees in each department - since both of them are measures, and not dimensions, the best chart would be a scatter plot</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='15'>Random Notes </run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='15'>- Change the link to the first navigation in the toolbar </run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
